This folder is a Python port of parts of the DiPlay CarPlay engine and is licensed under the
GNU General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE). It is kept on a test branch and is not part of
StarPilot releases.

Ported from:
- DiPlay by shihabal3amri (GPL-3.0), https://github.com/shihabal3amri/DiPlay
- xcertplay by shilapi (GPL-3.0), which DiPlay is based on
- as vendored in CarLink by F-e-n-y-x (AGPL-3.0), https://github.com/F-e-n-y-x/CarLink (vendor/diplay)

No Apple accessory identity is included. Each user uploads their own copy of the CarLink
release APK in Galaxy, and the device stores the key in /data/carplay-private/
(certificate.p7b, identity.pk8), which is never committed.

